AS configurations can be imported by their <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`id`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Id`" pulumi-lang-go="`id`" pulumi-lang-python="`id`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`id`" pulumi-lang-java="`id`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`id`">`id`</span>, e.g.

```sh
$ pulumi import sbercloud:index/asConfiguration:AsConfiguration test 18518c8a-9d15-416b-8add-2ee874751d18
