sbercloud:index/vpcPeeringConnectionAcce.description:
Provides a resource to manage the accepter's side of a VPC Peering Connection. This is an alternative
to <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`sbercloudVpcPeeringConnectionAccepterV2`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`SbercloudVpcPeeringConnectionAccepterV2`" pulumi-lang-go="`sbercloudVpcPeeringConnectionAccepterV2`" pulumi-lang-python="`sbercloud_vpc_peering_connection_accepter_v2`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`sbercloudVpcPeeringConnectionAccepterV2`" pulumi-lang-java="`sbercloudVpcPeeringConnectionAccepterV2`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`sbercloud_vpc_peering_connection_accepter_v2`">`sbercloudVpcPeeringConnectionAccepterV2`</span>

> **NOTE:** When a cross-tenant (requester's tenant differs from the accepter's tenant) VPC Peering Connection
  is created, a VPC Peering Connection resource is automatically created in the accepter's account.
  The requester can use the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnection`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnection`" pulumi-lang-go="`VpcPeeringConnection`" pulumi-lang-python="`VpcPeeringConnection`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnection`" pulumi-lang-java="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnection`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`sbercloud_vpc_peering_connection`">`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnection`</span> resource to manage its side of the connection and
  the accepter can use the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter`" pulumi-lang-go="`VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter`" pulumi-lang-python="`VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter`" pulumi-lang-java="`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`sbercloud_vpc_peering_connection_accepter`">`sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter`</span> resource to accept its side of the connection
  into management.

## Example Usage

<!--Start PulumiCodeChooser -->
```typescript
import * as pulumi from "@pulumi/pulumi";
import * as sbercloud from "@pulumi/sbercloud";

const vpcMain = new sbercloud.Vpc("vpc_main", {
    name: vpcName,
    cidr: vpcCidr,
});
const vpcPeer = new sbercloud.Vpc("vpc_peer", {
    name: peerVpcName,
    cidr: peerVpcCidr,
});
// Requester's side of the connection.
const peering = new sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnection("peering", {
    name: peerName,
    vpcId: vpcMain.id,
    peerVpcId: vpcPeer.id,
    peerTenantId: tenantId,
});
// Accepter's side of the connection.
const peer = new sbercloud.VpcPeeringConnectionAccepter("peer", {
    accept: true,
    vpcPeeringConnectionId: peering.id,
});
